libregf is a library to access the Windows NT Registry File (REGF) format.

Library and tool support is included for applying DIRT and HvLE transaction
logs (.LOG1 and .LOG2) to dirty hives. Use regfrecover to write the recovered
hive to a new file, for example: regfrecover -o SYSTEM.recovered SYSTEM

Project information:

* Status: alpha
* Licence: LGPL-3.0-or-later

Planned:

* Dokan support
* Multi-threading support

For more information see:

* Project documentation: https://github.com/libyal/libregf/wiki/Home
* How to build from source: https://github.com/libyal/libregf/wiki/Building

